---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CtaBand from '../components/CtaBand.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="About | Panhandle Headlight Restoration"
  description="Founded and operated by Nathan Spells in Marianna, Florida. A trade name of Aspect Media Holdings, LLC. Mobile headlight restoration serving the Florida Panhandle, South Alabama, and Southwest Georgia."
>
  <section class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">About</span>
      <h2>Local. Mobile. Backed in writing.</h2>
      <p>Panhandle Headlight Restoration is a mobile service based in Marianna, Florida. We come to your home, workplace, or lot, restore your headlights on-site, and back the work with a written guarantee.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="owner-block">
      <div class="owner-photo">
        <img src="/nathan.jpg" alt="Nathan Spells, founder of Panhandle Headlight Restoration" width="800" height="1067" />
      </div>
      <div class="owner-story">
        <span class="eyebrow">Founder & operator</span>
        <h3>Meet Nathan.</h3>
        <p>Hi, I&rsquo;m Nathan Spells. My wife&rsquo;s family has roots in the Florida Panhandle going back generations. We moved to Marianna five years ago and I&rsquo;ve been part of this community ever since, running Aspect Media Holdings, LLC from here. Panhandle Headlight Restoration is a service brand I launched under AMH after seeing local drivers get quoted $500 to $800 to replace headlights that are fixable in under two hours with the right tools and coating.</p>
        <p>I handle every job personally. On-site quotes before I start, real guarantees in writing (6, 18, or 36 months depending on the tier), and mobile service that comes to your driveway. If the finish doesn&rsquo;t meet the spec we agreed to, I redo it. That&rsquo;s the whole promise.</p>
        <div class="cta-row" style="margin-top:1.2rem;">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="sms:+18505836322?&body=Hi%20Nathan%2C%20I%27d%20like%20a%20headlight%20quote.">Text Nathan</a>
          <a class="btn btn-dark" href="tel:+18505836322">Call (850) 583-6322</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="split" style="margin-top:2.5rem;">
      <div>
        <div class="card" style="padding:1.6rem;">
          <h3 style="font-size:var(--h3);margin-bottom:.6rem;">Why we exist</h3>
          <p style="color:var(--muted);">Cheap restoration jobs in this climate haze back within months because they skip the sealing step. Florida&rsquo;s year-round UV index runs 10 to 11 &mdash; roughly twice the northern US average &mdash; and standard consumer kits are not rated for that. We built the service around the seal, not the sanding, and matched three professional coatings to three real durability windows.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="card" style="padding:1.6rem;">
          <h3 style="font-size:var(--h3);margin-bottom:.6rem;">Who we are</h3>
          <p style="color:var(--muted);">Panhandle Headlight Restoration is a trade name of Aspect Media Holdings, LLC, a Florida limited liability company based in Marianna, Jackson County. We stand behind our work with a written workmanship guarantee, and we back retail customers with a personal discount for military, veterans, law enforcement, first responders, and school employees.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="split" style="margin-top:2rem;">
      <div>
        <div class="card" style="padding:1.6rem;">
          <h3 style="font-size:var(--h3);margin-bottom:.6rem;">Where we work</h3>
          <p style="color:var(--muted);">Marianna and Jackson County are home base. From there we serve the wider Florida Panhandle, South Alabama, and Southwest Georgia. Free service within about 30 miles; a modest travel fee farther out. Full map on the <a href="/service-area/" style="color:var(--trust);text-decoration:underline;">service area</a> page.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="card" style="padding:1.6rem;">
          <h3 style="font-size:var(--h3);margin-bottom:.6rem;">How to reach us</h3>
          <p style="color:var(--muted);">Call or text <a href="tel:+18505836322" style="color:var(--trust);text-decoration:underline;">(850) 583-6322</a>, email <a href="mailto:info@panhandleheadlights.com" style="color:var(--trust);text-decoration:underline;">info@panhandleheadlights.com</a>, or start with a <a href="/quote/" style="color:var(--trust);text-decoration:underline;">free quote</a>. We reply by text, usually same day.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CtaBand />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .owner-block {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 320px 1fr;
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    align-items: start;
  }
  .owner-photo {
    border-radius: 12px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--card, #111);
    box-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
  }
  .owner-photo img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    aspect-ratio: 800 / 1067;
    object-fit: cover;
  }
  .owner-story {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: .6rem;
  }
  .owner-story h3 {
    font-size: var(--h2);
    margin: .3rem 0 .5rem;
  }
  .owner-story p {
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }
  @media (max-width: 780px) {
    .owner-block {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1.4rem;
    }
    .owner-photo {
      max-width: 320px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
  }
</style>
